{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TerrApocalipse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> </strong>Defend the planet Terra from relentless enemies. Confront a powerful, enigmatic invader whose aim is nothing less than total domination. In this vast, dynamic solar system, every planet, moon, and asteroid is a battlefield and\u00a0a valuable resource.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG-style progression</strong>\u00a0- Develop your commander along three unique paths  or forge your own hybrid playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strength -\u00a0</strong>win by  creating spaceships capable of single-handedly opposing countless enemy units.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wisdom -</strong> will allow you to develop futuristic technologies that will give you an advantage over your opponents. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leadership -</strong> create an armada that can defeat any opponent thanks to cooperation skills and good training.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/7927fac8e2d0008815129bf3f5634a8b.poster.avif?t=1774183824\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/7927fac8e2d0008815129bf3f5634a8b.webm?t=1774183824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/7927fac8e2d0008815129bf3f5634a8b.mp4?t=1774183824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather\u00a0knowledge -\u00a0</strong>Uncover hidden tech knowledge, dive into research and unlock alien technologies, advanced ships, weapons and systems.\u00a0Mine resources from asteroids or acquire them during battles. Expand space stations and logistics networks to supply your armada. Manage your crew and train spacefarers, scientists, and engineers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/02027bccc8162ebcf469b49bbcd855f4.poster.avif?t=1774183824\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/02027bccc8162ebcf469b49bbcd855f4.webm?t=1774183824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/02027bccc8162ebcf469b49bbcd855f4.mp4?t=1774183824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ship building &amp; customization</strong>\u00a0- Construct space stations, produce starships, upgrade your vessels and tailor your fleet to your strategic vision. Upgradeable equipment systems, each weapon and ship has up to 9 upgradeable parameters, each upgradable up to 20 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create equipment that will allow you to play the game in the way that is most enjoyable for you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight and conquer -\u00a0</strong>Every planet and moon has strategic value: defend, exploit or conquer.\u00a0Control your fleet in real time, where positioning and timing are key to victory. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the way you like</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4007500?t=1774183824","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4