an advantage over your opponents. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leadership -</strong> create an armada that can defeat any opponent thanks to cooperation skills and good training.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/7927fac8e2d0008815129bf3f5634a8b.poster.avif?t=1774183824\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/7927fac8e2d0008815129bf3f5634a8b.webm?t=1774183824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/7927fac8e2d0008815129bf3f5634a8b.mp4?t=1774183824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather\u00a0knowledge -\u00a0</strong>Uncover hidden tech knowledge, dive into research and unlock alien technologies, advanced ships, weapons and systems.\u00a0Mine resources from asteroids or acquire them during battles. Expand space stations and logistics networks to supply your armada. Manage your crew and train spacefarers, scientists, and engineers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/02027bccc8162ebcf469b49bbcd855f4.poster.avif?t=1774183824\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/02027bccc8162ebcf469b49bbcd855f4.webm?t=1774183824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/02027bccc8162ebcf469b49bbcd855f4.mp4?t=1774183824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ship building &amp; customization</strong>\u00a0- Construct space stations, produce starships, upgrade your vessels and tailor your fleet to your strategic vision. Upgradeable equipment systems, each weapon and ship has up to 9 upgradeable parameters, each upgradable up to 20 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create equipment that will allow you to play the game in the way that is most enjoyable for you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight and conquer -\u00a0</strong>Every planet and moon has strategic value: defend, exploit or conquer.\u00a0Control your fleet in real time, where positioning and timing are key to victory. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the way you like</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["StDesign"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/07d4c81a2274289d23a1030e265bca88a6051b09/header.jpg?t=1774183824","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-450M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 330M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul